         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Adding Large Numbers\n\nWe will add two numbers from 1 to 49 using only the first two columns of the abacus: the tens column and the units column. First, set the first number; then, add the second number. When the sum of a column exceeds 9, we use the complement to carry 1 to the next column.",
